     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nGreetings,</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nI hope this email finds you well. I am hoping to get into contact with the developer of the R package tRophicPosition. </div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nI am Master&#39;s student at Penn State, hoping to try and use tRophicPosition for a project, but found it had been removed from the CRAN repository. Are there any coming updates, or is the package no longer available?</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:0px;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nThank you for your help.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"color:inherit\">\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nCheers,</div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nOlivia</div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n____________________________________</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b>Olivia Hodgson</b></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<i>she/her/hers</i></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.huck.psu.edu/graduate-programs/ecology\" title=\"https://www.huck.psu.edu/graduate-programs/ecology\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.huck.psu.edu/graduate-programs/ecology&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497423051000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aeUOaDJV0qA2ZySvXUqB8\">M.S. Candidate, Ecology</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.huck.psu.edu/\" title=\"https://www.huck.psu.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.huck.psu.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497423051000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IlsCFffsgJmRZUL3ypFaO\">Huck Institutes of the Life Sciences</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><a href=\"https://www1.usgs.gov/coopunits/unit/Pennsylvania\" title=\"https://www1.usgs.gov/coopunits/unit/Pennsylvania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www1.usgs.gov/coopunits/unit/Pennsylvania&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497423